                <pb facs="0395" n="385" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg385"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">103.ECA/8–1448: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-08-16T15:00:00-04:00">August 16, 1948—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1186. Dept appreciative of your 1514, Aug 14 and is wholly in accord with Embs
                    view as expressed in the latter half of third from last para.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
